    <briefdescription>
<para>Content-policy sanitizer for image generation prompts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Blocks prompts containing any of the configured keywords (case-insensitive). Can be loaded from a YAML/text file (one keyword per line) or constructed directly from a vector of strings. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
